#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "You are signed in"
msgstr "Connexion réussie"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Enter your email address."
msgstr "Saisissez votre adresse e-mail."

# android: SystemUI biometric_dialog_enter_password (adapted, other app, several translations)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Enter your password."
msgstr "Saisissez votre mot de passe."

#: src/sw-account-pages.c src/sw-app-page.c src/sw-mine.c
msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "Se connecter"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid ""
"Sign in to rate and review apps, and to see your apps on all your devices."
msgstr ""
"Connectez-vous pour noter les applis, donner votre avis et retrouver vos "
"applis sur tous vos appareils."

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Email"
msgstr "E-mail"

# android: Settings unlock_set_unlock_password_title (short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Mot de passe"

# android: Settings lockpassword_forgot_password
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Forgot your password?"
msgstr "Mot de passe oublié ?"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "No account yet?"
msgstr "Pas encore de compte ?"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Create an account"
msgstr "Créer un compte"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Enter a name. It shows on your reviews."
msgstr "Saisissez un nom. Il apparaît sur vos avis."

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid ""
"With an account you can rate and review apps, and see your apps on all your "
"devices. The store emails you a code to confirm the address."
msgstr ""
"Avec un compte, vous pouvez noter les applis, donner votre avis et retrouver "
"vos applis sur tous vos appareils. La boutique vous envoie un code par e-"
"mail pour confirmer l'adresse."

# android: Settings security_settings_fingerprint_enroll_dialog_name_label (short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nom"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Shown on your reviews"
msgstr "Affiché sur vos avis"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "At least 8 characters"
msgstr "Au moins 8 caractères"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Create the account"
msgstr "Créer le compte"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Send a new code"
msgstr "Envoyer un nouveau code"

#. TRANSLATORS: %d is the seconds left until a new code can be asked for, "s" the abbreviation of seconds
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
#, c-format
msgid "Send a new code in %d s"
msgstr "Nouveau code dans %d s"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the store's message (a whole sentence), %d how many more codes may be tried
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
#, c-format
msgid "%s %d try left."
msgid_plural "%s %d tries left."
msgstr[0] "%s Il reste %d essai."
msgstr[1] "%s Il reste %d essais."

#. TRANSLATORS: %d is the code's length in digits, %s the email address
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The store sent a %d-digit code to %s. Enter it here to confirm the address. "
"It works for 15 minutes."
msgstr ""
"La boutique a envoyé un code à %d chiffres à %s. Saisissez-le ici pour "
"confirmer l'adresse. Il est valable 15 minutes."

#. TRANSLATORS: %d is the code's length in digits, %s the email address
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Confirm your address to rate and review apps: enter the %d-digit code the "
"store emailed to %s, or ask for a new one."
msgstr ""
"Confirmez votre adresse pour noter les applis et donner votre avis : "
"saisissez le code à %d chiffres que la boutique a envoyé à %s, ou demandez-"
"en un nouveau."

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "A new code is on its way"
msgstr "Un nouveau code est en route"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Your address is confirmed"
msgstr "Votre adresse est confirmée"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Confirm your email"
msgstr "Confirmez votre adresse e-mail"

# android: Settings security_settings_remoteauth_enroll_enrolling_agree (short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Confirmer"

# android: Aperture location_permission_dialog_later (other app, short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Later"
msgstr "Plus tard"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Your password is changed, and you are signed in"
msgstr "Mot de passe modifié, connexion réussie"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid ""
"Enter the address you signed up with. If it has an account, the store emails "
"a code to it to set a new password."
msgstr ""
"Saisissez l'adresse utilisée lors de l'inscription. Si elle correspond à un "
"compte, la boutique y envoie un code pour définir un nouveau mot de passe."

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Send the code"
msgstr "Envoyer le code"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the email address (partly hidden), %d the code's length in digits
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
#, c-format
msgid ""
"If %s has an account, a %d-digit code is on its way to it. Enter it here."
msgstr ""
"Si %s correspond à un compte, un code à %d chiffres est en route vers cette "
"adresse. Saisissez-le ici."

# android: Settings next_label (several translations, short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Suivant"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid ""
"Choose a new password. Every device signed in to the account is signed out, "
"and this one signed in."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez un nouveau mot de passe. Tous les appareils connectés au compte "
"seront déconnectés, et celui-ci sera connecté."

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "New password"
msgstr "Nouveau mot de passe"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Set the password"
msgstr "Définir le mot de passe"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "On Wi-Fi only"
msgstr "En Wi-Fi uniquement"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Not on a network that counts the data (a phone's mobile data)"
msgstr "Pas sur un réseau facturé à l'usage (données mobiles d'un téléphone)"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "On any network"
msgstr "Sur tous les réseaux"

#. TRANSLATORS: Mine is the tab of the apps on the device, "Check for updates" its button
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Only when I ask"
msgstr "Seulement quand je le demande"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Mine's Check for updates"
msgstr "Avec « Rechercher des mises à jour » dans Mes applis"

#. TRANSLATORS: the theme: light or dark as the system's
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "As the system"
msgstr "Comme le système"

# android: Etar preferences_light_theme (other app, short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Light"
msgstr "Clair"

# android: Etar preferences_dark_theme (other app, short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Dark"
msgstr "Sombre"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Software's settings are not installed."
msgstr "Les paramètres de Logiciels ne sont pas installés."

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Look for updates"
msgstr "Recherche de mises à jour"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid ""
"Software looks for updates when it starts and when apps change. It does not "
"install them by itself: update from Mine."
msgstr ""
"Logiciels recherche les mises à jour au démarrage et quand des applis "
"changent. Il ne les installe pas tout seul : mettez-les à jour depuis Mes "
"applis."

# android: Etar preferences_theme (other app, short)
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Thème"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "VibeOS apps only"
msgstr "Applis VibeOS uniquement"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "None of Debian's in the store's lists"
msgstr "Aucune appli Debian dans les listes de la boutique"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "About Software"
msgstr "À propos de Logiciels"

# android: PackageInstaller external_sources_settings
#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Paramètres"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid "The catalog"
msgstr "Le catalogue"

#: src/sw-account-pages.c
msgid ""
"The apps, their descriptions and pictures come from the store at vibeos.top, "
"which takes them from Debian's and VibeOS's software sources and the apps' "
"own AppStream data."
msgstr ""
"Les applis, leurs descriptions et leurs images proviennent de la boutique "
"vibeos.top, qui les tire des sources de logiciels de Debian et de VibeOS et "
"des données AppStream des applis elles-mêmes."

